{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FjbJ8bUMCdWjGKLC2f7Fec","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"use client\";\n2\t\n3\timport { useEffect, useEffectEvent } from \"react\";\n4\timport { trackBeginCheckout } from \"@/lib/gtm-ecommerce\";\n5\t\n6\tconst CHECKOUT_ITEMS = [\n7\t  {\n8\t    item_id: \"standard-capsule-pod\",\n9\t    item_name: \"Standard Capsule Pod\",\n10\t    item_category: \"accommodation\",\n11\t    price: 35,\n12\t    currency: \"MYR\",\n13\t  },\n14\t];\n15\t\n16\texport default function BookEcommerceTracker() {\n17\t  // Initialize GA4 custom dimension for A/B test variant on mount\n18\t  useEffect(() => {\n19\t    if (typeof window === \"undefined\") return;\n20\t    const variant = document.cookie\n21\t      .split(\"; \")\n22\t      .find((row) => row.startsWith(\"x-variant=\"))\n23\t      ?.split(\"=\")[1] || \"book-now\";\n24\t\n25\t    // Set custom dimension for variant tracking in GA4\n26\t    const w = window as unknown as { dataLayer: Record<string, unknown>[] };\n27\t    w.dataLayer = w.dataLayer || [];\n28\t    w.dataLayer.push({\n29\t      event: \"page_view\",\n30\t      \"dimension_1\": variant, // dimension_1 = CTA variant (configure in GA4)\n31\t    });\n32\t  }, []);\n33\t\n34\t  const handleBookNowClick = useEffectEvent((e: MouseEvent) => {\n35\t    const target = e.target as HTMLElement;\n36\t    const link = target.closest(\"a[href*='wa.me'], a[href='#booking'], .btn-primary\");\n37\t    if (link) {\n38\t      // Include variant in ecommerce tracking\n39\t      const variant = document.cookie\n40\t        .split(\"; \")\n41\t        .find((row) => row.startsWith(\"x-variant=\"))\n42\t        ?.split(\"=\")[1] || \"book-now\";\n43\t\n44\t      trackBeginCheckout(CHECKOUT_ITEMS);\n45\t\n46\t      // Log CTA click with variant\n47\t      const w = window as unknown as { dataLayer: Record<string, unknown>[] };\n48\t      w.dataLayer = w.dataLayer || [];\n49\t      w.dataLayer.push({\n50\t        event: \"cta_click\",\n51\t        \"dimension_1\": variant,\n52\t      });\n53\t    }\n54\t  });\n55\t\n56\t  useEffect(() => {\n57\t    document.addEventListener(\"click\", handleBookNowClick);\n58\t    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"click\", handleBookNowClick);\n59\t  }, []);\n60\t\n61\t  return null;\n62\t}\n63\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"064c2877-3a27-4cc4-93b1-67ad4599ceeb","uuid":"bc791180-31ee-41ec-b0e8-95ac478435ef","timestamp":"2026-04-14T06:46:33.013Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\components\\BookEcommerceTracker.tsx","content":"\"use client\";\n\nimport { useEffect, useEffectEvent } from \"react\";\nimport { trackBeginCheckout } from \"@/lib/gtm-ecommerce\";\n\nconst CHECKOUT_ITEMS = [\n  {\n    item_id: \"standard-capsule-pod\",\n    item_name: \"Standard Capsule Pod\",\n    item_category: \"accommodation\",\n    price: 35,\n    currency: \"MYR\",\n  },\n];\n\nexport default function BookEcommerceTracker() {\n  // Initialize GA4 custom dimension for A/B test variant on mount\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (typeof window === \"undefined\") return;\n    const variant = document.cookie\n      .split(\"; \")\n      .find((row) => row.startsWith(\"x-variant=\"))\n      ?.split(\"=\")[1] || \"book-now\";\n\n    // Set custom dimension for variant tracking in GA4\n    const w = window as unknown as { dataLayer: Record<string, unknown>[] };\n    w.dataLayer = w.dataLayer || [];\n    w.dataLayer.push({\n      event: \"page_view\",\n      \"dimension_1\": variant, // dimension_1 = CTA variant (configure in GA4)\n    });\n  }, []);\n\n  const handleBookNowClick = useEffectEvent((e: MouseEvent) => {\n    const target = e.target as HTMLElement;\n    const link = target.closest(\"a[href*='wa.me'], a[href='#booking'], .btn-primary\");\n    if (link) {\n      // Include variant in ecommerce tracking\n      const variant = document.cookie\n        .split(\"; \")\n        .find((row) => row.startsWith(\"x-variant=\"))\n        ?.split(\"=\")[1] || \"book-now\";\n\n      trackBeginCheckout(CHECKOUT_ITEMS);\n\n      // Log CTA click with variant\n      const w = window as unknown as { dataLayer: Record<string, unknown>[] };\n      w.dataLayer = w.dataLayer || [];\n      w.dataLayer.push({\n        event: \"cta_click\",\n        \"dimension_1\": variant,\n      });\n    }\n  });\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    document.addEventListener(\"click\", handleBookNowClick);\n    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"click\", handleBookNowClick);\n  }, []);\n\n  return null;\n}\n","numLines":63,"startLine":1,"totalLines":63}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_015ZBNi1ARoR8CAE933YNdrw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! The BookEcommerceTracker already has GA4 integration for tracking the variant using `dimension_1`. Now let me check if there's a .env file with EDGE_CONFIG configured, and what's needed to activate the middleware.\n\nThe story requirements are:\n1. ✓ @vercel/edge-config and @vercel/flags packages installed\n2. ? Vercel Edge Config store created and connected (need to verify EDGE_CONFIG env var)\n3. ✓ A/B flag defined for /book page primary CTA copy\n4. ✗ Flag evaluated in Next.js Middleware (middleware.ts.bak exists but not active)\n5. ✓ GA4 custom dimension records which variant each session received\n6. ? Vercel Flags UI in dashboard shows flag status\n\nSo what I need to do:\n1. Restore/activate middleware.ts from the .bak file\n2. Verify EDGE_CONFIG is properly set in environment\n3. Check vercel.json for Flags configuration\n\nLet me check the environment and vercel.json.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1098,"cache_read_input_tokens":72296,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1098},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"064c2877-3a27-4cc4-93b1-67ad4599ceeb","uuid":"4fdfd944-ee21-46d9-8112-204c45751a2a"}
