{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01PtbVpwMkPwcFCs1U5VtLVy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I understand the situation. Let me produce the **diagnosis** and **plan** before making any changes:\n\n## Current State\n- `flags.ts` exists with proper flag types (`CTAVariant`) and `getVariant()` function\n- `middleware.ts.bak` contains the correct middleware implementation but is not active\n- `/book/page.tsx` already uses variant from headers and GA4 tracking is in place via `BookEcommerceTracker.tsx`\n- `@vercel/edge-config` and `@vercel/flags` packages already installed\n- No active `middleware.ts` file (only .bak)\n- No `vercel.json` for Edge Config configuration\n\n## Problem Identified\nPrevious attempt failed with 12854-line oversized diff. The actual implementation needed is minimal:\n1. **Activate middleware.ts** - restore from .bak\n2. **Add NEXT_PUBLIC_FLAG_CTA_VARIANT to .env.local** - for local dev\n3. **Create vercel.json** - to enable Vercel Flags UI in dashboard (minimal config)\n4. **Verify acceptance criteria** - all already implemented or in place\n\nThe large diff was likely caused by including unrelated file modifications (e.g., from prior failed attempts). This iteration focuses on the minimal essential pieces.\n\n## Planned Changes\n1. **site/src/middleware.ts** - restore from .bak (49 lines)\n2. **site/.env.local** - add NEXT_PUBLIC_FLAG_CTA_VARIANT variable (1 line)\n3. **site/vercel.json** - create minimal Edge Config + Flags configuration (15 lines)\n\n<plan>\n{\n  \"files_to_create\": [\"site/vercel.json\"],\n  \"files_to_modify\": [\"site/src/middleware.ts\", \"site/.env.local\"],\n  \"functions_to_add\": [],\n  \"estimated_loc\": 70\n}\n</plan>\n\nNow executing the plan:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":234,"cache_read_input_tokens":75877,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_inpu