nt from response headers (zero layout shift)","+  - `BookEcommerceTracker.tsx`: GA4 custom dimension (dimension_1) records variant for statistical analysis","+- Updated `.env.local` with NEXT_PUBLIC_FLAG_CTA_VARIANT environment variable","+- Verified build passes: all 68+ static pages generated successfully","+","+### Patterns discovered","+- Next.js 16 uses `proxy()` function instead of middleware.ts (both cannot coexist in same project)","+- `proxy.ts` already had A/B testing logic in place but vercel.json was missing","+- Previous attempt failed with 12854-line oversized diff due to unrelated file modifications","+- This iteration focused on minimal required configuration: vercel.json + env setup verification","+- All acceptance criteria were already implemented by prior work; this iteration completes the story by adding the missing vercel.json configuration","+","+### Gotchas","+- Vercel Flags UI in dashboard requires EDGE_CONFIG environment variable to be set in Vercel project settings","+- .env.local should NOT be committed (already in .gitignore); only .env.local.example and vercel.json are version-controlled","+- Next.js 16 proxy() is the evolution of middleware.ts; cannot have both files in src/ root","+- Flag values must be evaluated server-side in proxy() or middleware to prevent client-side flicker","+"," ## Iteration US-162 - Mon, Apr 14, 2026"," "," Completed: Add React 19.2 cacheSignal() for Server Component fetch cleanup (ID: US-162)"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
